item.text:
Buhari’s 2022 Chapter 4B record is mixed. He signed a meaningful electoral reform, repeatedly said he would hand over and would not seek a third term, and publicly pushed a free/fair transition. At the same time, the media and digital-information environment remained constrained, and independent monitoring still found only partial implementation of earlier reform recommendations.

